{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013-r1\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a107a2-e9e4-7670-bc44-1144fa9b27e2\", \"kind\": \"quality\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"fc1e90ca45817344c3100c2924926babdd024455\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-001998\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/material-0.txt\": \"9c157300fa54608a2fee286675631a1eb3456f2e6a36404bc84e15dcdf635667\", \".evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/material-1.txt\": \"c73eb170859d043efa94c9b99dedb24bfe00e69c3af1a366a33f066c95a795c1\", \".evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/material-2.txt\": \"33d5ae3819e918fd20430b95a3d7b1c4fffd5dc2d7608d04c8badfef6447d61b\", \".evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/material-3.txt\": \"70ed34f37c8545c7634c0648248161564f9d5481bbc3433fb1dd9d46476f70b8\"}}, \"claims\": [\"Fresh independent durable-volume full restore completed with 650 tables and roles/memberships/sequences equal; source untouched.\", \"Exactly two named CHECK lines differ only by associative AND regrouping with identical three operands; every other schema byte equals.\", \"Current database and business authority remain unchanged; clone-only native CAS/idempotency continuation is pending, with previous failed attempts retained and not replayed.\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/material-0.txt\": \"# 当前 Host OID 有界持久卷全库恢复演练\\n\\nRules：aos-engineering-delivery、231-4恢复/历史审计、231-6串行交付、当前01/06与明确栖月汇恢复授权。唯一m1写者、原库只读、先方案后脚本、不push；新代码仅本目录rehearse.py，不修改产品或既有用户改动。\\n\\n已登记候选A：当前Host OID独立全恢复，依赖新鲜双备份、原bootstrap、资源余量、完整恢复及原维护CAS门；候选B：Source reader/Plan锁耦合隔离兼容，依赖恢复已归档Source实验数据。选择A，历史tmpfs失败不重放。\\n\\n新容器与同名命名卷qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013；原CID84989681fb7d3fc0f42d750672547ca0208fbba08dfef0d93837d8e64245